\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces A summary of the electron definitions used in the analysis. Signal electrons are used for the cross section measurement, while background electrons are used in the overlap removal. $d_0$ and $z_0$ are the transverse and longitudinal impact parameters introduced in Section~\ref {sec:ObjRecl:Tracks}}}{26}{table.caption.14}%
